{"schema_version":1,"id":"8rlcsybg2hhe","type":"collection","subtype":"book_collection","title":"二十四史","description":{"text":"清乾隆四年（1739年）起武英殿陸續校刊二十四部正史，至乾隆四十九年（1784年）全部完成，歷時四十餘年。全書共3213卷，約四千萬字，採用紀傳體，記載自傳說中的黃帝至明崇禎十七年（1644年）的歷史。殿本以刻印精良、校勘嚴謹著稱，為清代通行正史標準本，沿用三百餘年。","sources":[]},"contained_in":["8rlcsybg2hhi","8rlcsybg2hhd"],"authors":[{"name":"紀昀","role":"總校官","dynasty":"清"}],"resources":[{"id":"ctext","name":"中國哲學書電子化計劃","short_name":"CText","url":"https://ctext.org/library.pl?if=en&collection=7","details":"武英殿二十四史完整影像，24部全部收錄，可在線逐頁瀏覽。","types":["image"]}],"publication_info":{"year":"1739-1784","details":"清乾隆四年至四十九年武英殿陸續校刊"},"dating":{"era":"清","year":1739,"certainty":"attested","source":"catalog","basis":"出版著錄「1739-1784」"},"juan_count":{"number":3213,"description":"全書共3213卷，約四千萬字"},"edition":"武英殿本","books":["988g46t152","988g63603v","988g0sg07f","988g2u40e8","988g7a8r2g","988g03s9al","988g3dgq33","988g2etdsd","988g8rmbyb","988g4i1kp8","988g393eh3","988g4749ot","988g23ku81","988g75vfgv","988g3z03k0","988fzwx1c0","988g1lh2q7","988g2rxcln","988fzafy86","988g0w6uq2","988g7resy3","988g7g69e8","988g2e6wp1","988g2f4mbt"],"updated_at":"2026-08-26T00:00:00+00:00","_has_image":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Collection/h/h/e/8rlcsybg2hhe-二十四史武英殿本.json","_isDraft":false}